SUMMARY:Stand Up Comedy: Orlando Baxter | 8:00PM Show
LOCATION:Scottie's
DESCRIPTION:Category: The Arts\nPrice: Free\nStatus: You are on Waitlist\nE
 vent URL: https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/203607\n\nOrlando Baxter
  brings his sharp\, deeply relatable comedy to The ’House for an evening
  of stand-up inspired by family\, relationships\, work\, and the everyday 
 absurdities of life. A former public high school teacher\, Orlando spent 1
 2 years in the classroom—an experience that continues to shape his quick
  wit\, natural storytelling\, and unmistakable point of view.\n\nSince tra
 ding lesson plans for the stage\, Orlando has entertained audiences around
  the world\, appeared on Conan\, and earned more than five million views 
 for his comedy special\, Glorified Baby Sitter.\n\nEnjoy a pre-show cockt
 ail from the cash bar before settling in for the performance. Seating is f
 irst come\, first served.\n\nMake a night of it with a burger and beer in 
 The Pub before the show. Dining walk-ins are welcome.\n\n*This event is av
 ailable for members and up to one registered guest. Complimentary light b
 ites and refreshments will be served. We kindly ask that all cancellations
  be made at least 24 hours prior to the start of the event.
URL:https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/203607
CATEGORIES:The Arts
